      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under inert glovebox/Schlenk conditions, toluene was added to pre-weighed [La(NR2)3] (R = SiMe3). Excess H-TFA was added until gas evolution ceased and a solvent bilayer formed. The unstirred mixture was heated until the layers mixed, then cooled with the cap loose until crystals grew.",
